<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Has Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Rally: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>墨西哥机场运营商 GAP 为 Fibra Trust 融资 3.98 亿美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mexican-airport-operator-gap-raises-398-million-for-fibra-trust</link><description>墨西哥机场运营商 Grupo Aeroportuario del Pacifico SAB de CV 为能源和基础设施信托基金筹集了 78 亿比索（3.98 亿美元），低于原计划，并且经历了数月的延误。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mexican-airport-operator-gap-raises-398-million-for-fibra-trust'&gt;墨西哥机场运营商 GAP 为 Fibra Trust 融资 3.98 亿美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mexican Airport Operator GAP Raises $398 Million for Fibra Trust&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mexican-airport-operator-gap-raises-398-million-for-fibra-trust</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:05:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil’s Real Caps Best Week Since 2020 as Trabuco Lifts Mood&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</link><description>标准普尔全球评级将匈牙利主权债务前景从负面上调至稳定，理由是总理彼得·马扎尔内阁计划采取措施削减预算赤字并最终采用欧元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition'&gt;标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hungary Credit Outlook Lifted by S&amp;P on Budget and Euro Ambition&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:19:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging-Market Stocks Snag Best Week Since June on Tech Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>